# SquadForge product rules (locked)

Private FPL for friends. Stack: FastAPI + SQLite + Jinja phone UI. Scoring in Python; players from FPL API. Product owner: Manuel (PM). Prefer ship in code over long design debates.

Canonical longer docs: `docs/CHIPS.md`, `docs/TECHNICAL_DIRECTOR.md`, `docs/FORMULAS.md`, `docs/RULES_WHATSAPP.txt`.

## Squad & transfers

- Squad **15** = **2 GK / 5 DEF / 5 MID / 3 ATT**, budget **£100m**, max **3 per club**
- Transfers: **GW1 unlimited**; after that **+1 FT / GW**, banked, **cap 5**
- Over FTs → **−4 hit** each (still allow the transfer)
- **WC** or **FH** active that GW → unlimited transfers (no hits)
- Deadline from FPL locks transfers, chips, lineup edits for that GW

## Lineup & armband

- Captain + Vice only (**C** / **V** badges). No other armband UI
- Captain scores **×2**. If captain plays **0 minutes**, vice gets the armband
- **Triple Captain** replaces ×2 with **×3** that GW (does not stack)

## Chips (one chip per manager per GW)

| Chip | Effect | Uses |
|------|--------|------|
| Wildcard | Unlimited transfers until deadline | 2 — 2nd unlocks **from GW20** |
| Free Hit | Temp 15 for **one GW**; snapshot restores after GW (or on cancel) | 1 |
| Bench Boost | Bench points count that GW | 1 |
| Triple Captain | Captain ×3 | 1 |
| Super Sub | One bench pick ×2 if they play/autosub; **consumed even if unused** | 1 *(not shipped yet)* |

Cancel chips **before deadline** restores remaining count (FH also restores ownership from snapshot).

## Technical Director (not a chip)

- Pick a club for **exactly 3 consecutive GWs**, then locked
- Scoring per real match: **W +3 / D +1 / L −1** (DGW each match; blank = 0)
- Cannot re-pick the **same club** as previous window

## Scoring & UX conventions

- Custom **per-position formulas** (see `docs/FORMULAS.md` + `backend/app/scoring/`)
- Autosubs like FPL when BB off
- UI: phone-first pitch Squad (pick 15 + transfers); nav Home · Squad · Points · Lineup · Table
- Real FPL kits via `kits.py`; compact chip strip; opponent peek on standings
- Player detail: long-press pitch / locked tap / picker **i** — name, club, pos, price, status, news

## When changing rules mid-season

Apply from the **next GW**, or bump `formula_version` / chip rules and leave finished GWs as played.
